{"rpid": "2251572", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "云腾", "mid": "27015", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "还不是因为武器太差 堵枪膛的几率太高，\n要不然正常人怎么会玩排队枪毙这种招数。\n\n1对1比几率看谁先不哑火好呢，还是比排队枪毙来算宏观期望来的好？\n仔细想下就知道了。欧洲人又不傻逼，为啥要这么干自然有缘由", "like": 1, "ctime": 1320305709, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "154358", "video_bvid": "BV1wx411w7iW", "video_title": "英国掷弹兵进行曲", "video_desc": "嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟……", "video_owner": "ztorpshark", "video_view": 35664, "video_reply": 94, "video_n1": 68, "video_n2": 26}
{"rpid": "2202558", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "大萌神TT", "mid": "61333", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "一群没有战争常识的白痴！在这里JJYY！好好看看历史的时间轴！再看看武器和战术的发展史！！ \n再来这里JJYY！！乱叫只会显得更无知！！！", "like": 1, "ctime": 1319560587, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "154358", "video_bvid": "BV1wx411w7iW", "video_title": "英国掷弹兵进行曲", "video_desc": "嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟……", "video_owner": "ztorpshark", "video_view": 35664, "video_reply": 94, "video_n1": 68, "video_n2": 26}
{"rpid": "2146615", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "ztorpshark", "mid": "105799", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "有人尊敬亚历山大，也有人崇拜赫拉克勒斯\n或是海克托尔，或是利山达。或是许多许多这样的英雄\n但是就是全世界的英雄里，也没有一个能和他比\n能和那啦啦啦啦英国掷弹兵比 　　\n那些古代英雄没见过炮弹铁丸\n也没见过那轰杀敌人的火药\n但我们勇敢的小伙子都见过，而且早已无所畏惧\n哦为啦啦啦啦英国掷弹兵歌唱吧\n当我们被命令向工事冲锋时\n我们的队长举起雷管，而我们点起手榴弹\n我们从斜堤上丢出它们，砸到敌人的耳朵上\n哦为啦啦啦啦英国掷弹兵歌唱吧\n当攻城结束，我们进城休整\n那些城里佬就叫唤着“哦小子看啊！来了个掷弹兵！\n来了个掷弹兵！那些家伙毫不犹豫，也不知道啥叫怕！” 　　\n哦为啦啦啦啦英国掷弹兵歌唱吧！ 　　\n然后让我们装满大杯，为那些家伙的健康祝酒！\n愿那些戴着帽子背着包，穿着漂亮大外套的大头兵\n还有他们的指挥官，得享天年，欢乐幸福！\n还有那啦啦啦啦啦！为了英国掷弹兵！ \n", "like": 5, "ctime": 1318740490, "rcount": 1, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "154358", "video_bvid": "BV1wx411w7iW", "video_title": "英国掷弹兵进行曲", "video_desc": "嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟……", "video_owner": "ztorpshark", "video_view": 35664, "video_reply": 94, "video_n1": 68, "video_n2": 26}
{"rpid": "2146610", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "ztorpshark", "mid": "105799", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "Whene'er we are commanded to storm the palisades,\nOur leaders march with fusees, and we with hand grenades.\nWe throw them from the glacis*, about the enemies' ears.\nSing tow, row, row, row, row, row, the British Grenadiers.\nAnd when the siege is over, we to the town repair.\nThe townsmen cry, &quot;Hurrah, boys, here comes a Grenadier!\nHere come the Grenadiers, my boys, who know no doubts or fears!\nThen sing tow, row, row, row, row, row, the British Grenadiers.\nThen let us fill a bumper, and drink a health to those\nWho carry caps and pouches, and wear the loupèd clothes.\nMay they and their commanders live happy all their years.\nWith a tow, row, row, row, row, row, for the British Grenadiers.&quot; \n", "like": 1, "ctime": 1318740468, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "154358", "video_bvid": "BV1wx411w7iW", "video_title": "英国掷弹兵进行曲", "video_desc": "嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟……", "video_owner": "ztorpshark", "video_view": 35664, "video_reply": 94, "video_n1": 68, "video_n2": 26}
{"rpid": "2146603", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "ztorpshark", "mid": "105799", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "Some talk of Alexander, and some of Hercules\nOf Hector and Lysander, and such great names as these.\nBut of all the world's great heroes, there's none that can compare.\nWith a tow, row, row, row, row, row, to the British Grenadiers.\nThose heroes of antiquity ne'er saw a cannon ball,\nOr knew the force of powder to slay their foes withal.\nBut our brave boys do know it, and banish all their fears,\nSing tow, row, row, row, row, row, for the British Grenadiers.\n", "like": 0, "ctime": 1318740436, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "154358", "video_bvid": "BV1wx411w7iW", "video_title": "英国掷弹兵进行曲", "video_desc": "嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟嘟，嘟-嘟嘟……", "video_owner": "ztorpshark", "video_view": 35664, "video_reply": 94, "video_n1": 68, "video_n2": 26}
